  "content": "\n\n<p>是否想在不删除任何原有生物的情况下，为游戏添加 Glare？这个资源包正好可以满足你的需求。该材质包将 Origin Realms 中的 Glare 加入了游戏中。只需使用命名牌将一只蜜蜂命名为“Glare”，它就会瞬间变成 Glare。<br>每个 Glare 都有两种不同的样式：普通样式和带有盛开花朵的授粉样式。当它为花朵授粉后，就会转变为授粉样式。不仅如此，它还拥有发光的双眼！！</p>\n<hr>\n<p>所有命名变种<br><strong>● \"Glare\"</strong><br><strong>● \"Bloom\"</strong><br><strong>● \"Monsoon\"</strong><br><strong>● \"Scowl\"</strong><br><strong>● \"Scare\" 由 6_28318530717958 命名</strong><br><strong>● \"Flare\"</strong><br><strong>● \"Voidling\"</strong><br><strong>● \"Festive Glare\" 感谢 Cloaky1 协助</strong><br><strong>● \"Chill\"</strong><br><strong>● \"Frostle\" 由 Gills 命名</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Max's Better Mobs<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/maxs-better-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4JecwoY.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>制作：creepermax123<br></strong><strong>基于：Origin Realms 中的 Glare</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/slml9Zy.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/91EJGkI.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b8VtDma.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>为确保资源包正常工作，请前往<br>选项&gt;视频设置&gt;画质<br>并确保以下选项已开启<br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>自定义实体模型：开启<br>自发光纹理：开启<br>随机实体：开启<br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/creepermax123/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HSH1isT.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fcreepermax123%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fQrYSAM.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creepermax123\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sh1fybT.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fcreepermax123\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RKoxW2v.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEPwxcy6Mtb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JpIsB0x.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\"></a></p>",
